 of them  to the final selection test he is slow  to warm to other people but he shows a  love for his students that is deep and  profound the moment where tan Jiro  returns from the test a new Roku ducky  drops everything to run after him and  hug him is one of the highlights of this  series for me the moment itself is so  simple but the situation just has so  much weight to it and it is definitely  one of the most powerful moments in the  series I also found it amazing to learn  that in order to get the Demon Slayer  Corps to agree to letting musical live  both eurocode Aki and GU agreed to  commit seppuku  if Natsu ko ever ended up hurting an  innocent person that is how much faith  these two have in tangier oh and Natsuko  and I find that truly heartwarming and  that is it for our video on all 9  pillars and their powers for more  specific info on everyone's breath style  feel free to check out the old 15 battle  styles explained video link in the  description please let me know down in  the comments who is your favorite out of  the 9 pillars and why personally I'm a  pretty big fan of ghee you I love the  fact that despite being common cold on  the outside he showed such trust in  tangier oh and mezu coal that he was  willing to place his own life on the  line for them that is really powerful  especially when we look back to give you  in Episode one and chapter one and how  all of this started if you enjoyed the  Demon Slayer content on this channel you  want to see more you can leave a like to  let me know and if you're new to anime  uproar please don't forget to subscribe  and hit that notification bell a big  shout out to my friend Excel Yan for  helping me with this video with the  research and also with the visual  editing working with him has been a  pleasure please check out his channel  link in the description and show him  some love he just made a new video on  Angel Beats which is an anime that I  adore and I really enjoyed the video so  definitely ch